OL,3,GNEWSAWonky elm named UK Tree of the
OL,4,AYear
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "bendy" wych elm has been crowned the
OL,7,FUK's Tree of the Year 2026 - the first
OL,8,Ftime a tree in Northern Ireland has won
OL,9,Fthe title.
OL,11,FThe 150-year-old tree on the central
OL,12,Fpromenade in Newcastle, County Down
OL,13,Ftook more than 30% of the national
OL,14,Fpublic vote.
OL,16,FThe theme of the Woodland Trust's
OL,17,Fannual competition was Against All
OL,18,FOdds, with trees across the UK
OL,19,Fshortlisted for being impressive,
OL,20,Fbeautiful and sometimes baffling
OL,21,Fexamples of how nature can survive
OL,22,Fadversity.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
