OL,3,GNEWSAWonky elm named UK Tree of the
OL,4,AYear
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust's Northern Ireland director
OL,7,FJohn Martin said he had been rooting
OL,8,Ffor the "whimsical" tree to win and
OL,9,Fsaid tens of thousands of people across
OL,10,Fthe UK had clearly felt the same.
